odeSelector {aiops.lab/unavailable: true}` 与集群实际节点的标签完全不匹配，导致调度器无法找到符合条件的节点（证据 2、3、6）。\n\n该结论基于以下事实链条确立：\n1. 调度器事件明确报错“node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector”（事实 2）；\n2. 集群当前节点数为 3，且全部匹配失败（事实 3）；\n3. 资源请求量级极低，排除资源耗尽导致的调度失败（事实 4）；\n4. 监控状态持续为 Pending，排除网络分区或节点状态剧烈震荡（事实 5）。\n\n日志和 Tracing 维度因 Pod 未启动及工具执行权限受限未采集到有效应用数据，但不影响对调度阶段错误的判定。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 56.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 56.1s (Evidence 47.3s, RCA 8.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.051, "metrics": {"run_id": "fd97a0c3e8014fba", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.05165243148804, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "sc